            <div xml:id="d151">

                <pb facs="0216" n="134" xml:id="pg134"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 811.34537/49.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1911-02-11"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">February 11, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 623.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to previous correspondence in
                    regard to the enlargement of our naval station at Guantánamo, I have the honor
                    to transmit herewith a copy and translation of a confidential note dated the 8th
                    instant which I received from Sr. Sanguily, the Cuban secretary of state, last
                    night.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.],</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John B. Jackson.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d151-a1.xml" xpointer="d151-a1"/>
            </div>
